flowchart TD
    Alert{{Alert fires}}
    Assess[Assess impact]
    Mitigate[Apply mitigation]
    Recovered{Service recovered?}
    Escalate[Escalate to the owning team]
    Review[Write the postmortem]
    Closed{{Incident closed}}
    subgraph Signals[Signals]
        Logs[Service logs]
        Errors[Error-rate dashboard]
    end
    subgraph Playbooks[Playbooks]
        Runbook[Service runbook]
        Notes[Past incident notes]
    end
    Alert --> Assess
    Logs --> Assess
    Errors --> Assess
    Assess --> Mitigate
    Runbook --> Mitigate
    Notes --> Mitigate
    Mitigate --> Recovered
    Recovered -->|Yes| Review
    Recovered -->|No| Escalate
    Escalate -->|Try again| Mitigate
    Review --> Closed

    %% @main Alert Assess Mitigate Recovered Review Closed
    %% @retry Escalate -> Mitigate
    %% @side Signals Playbooks
